{"id":"prepositions-0061","taskId":"prepositions","title":"Drill set 61","text":null,"source":"drill","gaps":[{"answer":"of","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Water consists ___ two hydrogen atoms and one oxygen atom.","hint":"consist ___ (be made of)","explanation":"consist OF = be made of. Compare \u0027consist in\u0027 (= have as its essence), rare."},{"answer":"on","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"The surgeon operated ___ the patient for four hours.","hint":"operate ___ sb","explanation":"operate ON a patient (for a condition)."},{"answer":"about","accept":["by"],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"He was upset ___ losing his keys.","hint":"upset ___ sth","explanation":"upset ABOUT something (BY also possible)."},{"answer":"on","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"The film had an immediate effect ___ audiences.","hint":"effect ___ sth","explanation":"have an effect ON somebody/something."},{"answer":"between","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"There\u0027s a direct connection ___ diet and mood.","hint":"connection ___ A and B","explanation":"a connection/link BETWEEN two things."},{"answer":"for","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"Please forgive me ___ interrupting.","hint":"forgive sb ___ sth","explanation":"forgive somebody FOR something/doing something."},{"answer":"on","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"He spends far too much ___ computer games.","hint":"spend money/time ___ sth","explanation":"spend money/time ON something."},{"answer":"to","accept":[],"options":[],"base":null,"keyword":null,"lead":null,"sentence":"The museum donated the paintings ___ a local school.","hint":"donate sth ___ sb","explanation":"donate something TO a person/organisation."}]}